  "description": "The proposal is to extend the existing roof terrace onto the adjoining existing flat roof. The terrace will be enclosed using the same materials of the existing terrace (frosted glass balustrade on the sides and clear glass balustrade on the rear) and the privacy screen between the neighbouring property (70 Hanley Road) will be maintained for the extension of the terrace. 70 Hanley Road are also intending on submitting a comparable planning application to similarly extend their terrace. The proposal will have little to no impact on any other neighboring properties given the elevation on which the terrace extension is proposed. \n\nRelevant planning applications are P2022/4100/FUL and 970885. This proposal will extend the terrace to the same as approved within 970885 at the elevation approved in P2022/4100/FUL. The terrace will protrude outwards in-line with other properties on the street such as number 78 and number 80 Hanley Road. ",
